                    "ms:a.i#3",
                    "ms:a.i#4"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "reasoningChain": [
                "Follow the signal from glucagon at the membrane.",
                "Identify the intracellular relay and the enzyme using ATP.",
                "Identify the small second messenger leading to the enzyme cascade."
              ],
